  "details": "I remember when \"Status\" came out and only friends could see them which was great due to me having bad anxiety, currently the \"Status\" and \"Bio\" are public only. Due to my anxiety I rarely use those features, but if it had a toggle between public and friends only I would be able to use those amazing features without the stress and anxiety. Here is hoping my suggestion helps others in my situation and/or others with other reasons.\n\nSincerely, long time user and long time supporter ThatKindOfGamer_",
